category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libintl-devel libopus-devel libssl-devel nlohmann_json zlib-devel
sdesc: "C++ Discord API Bot Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "D++ is a lightweight and efficient library for Discord written in modern C++,
covering as much of the API specification as possible with an incredibly small
memory footprint even when caching large amounts of data."
